    "body": "Fullscreen inside of `<frame>` used to work in Chromium. But here it's `frame.requestFullscreen()` so not exactly the situation. Disallowing this would be straightforward and fine I think, unlikely to be a web compat problem. Care to send spec+test PRs?",
