    "created_at": "2018-01-03T13:16:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-03T13:16:55Z",
    "body": "Fullscreen inside of `<frame>` should have been forbidden by the \"allowed to use\" algorithm anyway. Also `<frame>` being able to enter fullscreen is the prerequisite for its content to do so, like `<iframe>`.\r\n\r\nIt is not clear to me how would fullscreen be applied for `<frame>` given that it cannot go out-of-flow...\r\n\r\nI can do the spec+test... when I have time at some point...",
