    "body": "> Fullscreen inside of `<frame>` should have been forbidden by the \"allowed to use\" algorithm anyway.\r\n\r\nRight, but it [used to work](https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/32a059337eb1c538242091adc170c41be325443b), is all, which just means that whatever the problem is in Gecko probably doesn't apply to Chromium. I'm still fine with not allowing it.",
